<title>UK: Quezon Power sets $203 mln 20-year Yankee bond.</title>
<headline>Quezon Power sets $203 mln 20-year Yankee bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Yankee bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   QUEZON POWER (PHILIPPINES) LTD CO</p>
<p> AMT    $203 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *15.JUN.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+245-250</p>
<p> BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	    *CALLABLE AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY	BA1	 LISTING    NONE	GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB+	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
